on:\nI should make a value bet of around 2500. My pair of Queens is likely ahead given opponent's passive play throughout all streets. They've just called my flop and turn raises, suggesting a medium-strength hand like a weaker pair or missed draw. A bet of 2500 gives them reasonable odds to call with hands I beat while not overcommitting my stack. If they raise, I can fold and still maintain a competitive chip position.\n\nAnswer: 2500"}
